### Give the card a due date, mark it complete, and set a reminder 60 minutes before the due date.
PUT {{prodigy_board_API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/cards/{{cardId}}
X-User-Id: {{actorId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Write the spec",
  "dueDate": "2026-10-01T17:00:00Z",
  "isDueComplete": true,
  "dueReminderMinutes": 60,
  "labelIds": ["{{labelId}}"]
}

### Search complete cards. A card with no due date matches neither true nor false, so an undated card never comes back.
GET {{prodigy_board_API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/cards?isDueComplete=true

### Search cards due before a time. The dueBefore key matches dueDate < value.
GET {{prodigy_board_API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/cards?dueBefore=2026-10-02T00:00:00Z

### Search cards due on a given day. A card with no due date never matches.
GET {{prodigy_board_API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/cards?dueDate=2026-10-01

