### Add one label to the card. 204.
POST {{prodigy_board_API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/cards/{{toggleCardId}}/labels/{{otherBugId}}
X-User-Id: {{actorId}}

### Read the card. labelIds holds the label, and updatedBy is the actor, because the set changed.
GET {{prodigy_board_API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/cards/{{toggleCardId}}

### Add the same label again. 204, and the card's updatedAt doesn't move, because the set didn't change.
POST {{prodigy_board_API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/cards/{{toggleCardId}}/labels/{{otherBugId}}
X-User-Id: {{actorId}}

### Read the card again to compare updatedAt with the read above.
GET {{prodigy_board_API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/cards/{{toggleCardId}}

### Take the label off. 204.
DELETE {{prodigy_board_API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/cards/{{toggleCardId}}/labels/{{otherBugId}}
X-User-Id: {{actorId}}

### Take it off again. 204, and nothing changes.
DELETE {{prodigy_board_API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/cards/{{toggleCardId}}/labels/{{otherBugId}}
X-User-Id: {{actorId}}

