### Search boards by isArchived. 400 unknownField on isArchived.
GET {{prodigy_board_API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/boards?isArchived=true

### Send a list an archived name that doesn't exist. 400 unknownValue on archived.
GET {{prodigy_board_API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/lists?archived=Nope

### Send a board an archived name that doesn't exist. 400 unknownValue on archived.
GET {{prodigy_board_API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/boards?archived=Nope

### Send labels an archived name. 400 unknownField on archived, because label search has no such key.
GET {{prodigy_board_API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/labels?archived=only

### Archive the list. 204.
PUT {{prodigy_board_API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/lists/{{archiveListId}}/archived
X-User-Id: {{actorId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "value": true
}

### Read card A. Its isArchived is still false, because archiving a list writes only the list's own flag.
GET {{prodigy_board_API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/cards/{{archiveCardA}}

### Search cards in the archived list. Nothing comes back, because the default hides cards under an archived list.
GET {{prodigy_board_API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/cards?listId={{archiveListId}}

### Search the card archive view. Card B comes back and card A doesn't, because card A is hidden, not archived.
GET {{prodigy_board_API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/cards?listId={{archiveListId}}&archived=only

### Search the archived list's cards with archived=include. Both come back.
GET {{prodigy_board_API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/cards?listId={{archiveListId}}&archived=include

### Search lists on the board. The archived list is gone under the default.
GET {{prodigy_board_API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/lists?boardId={{archiveBoardId}}

### Search the list archive view. The list comes back.
GET {{prodigy_board_API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/lists?boardId={{archiveBoardId}}&archived=only

### Read the archived list by id. 200 in any state.
GET {{prodigy_board_API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/lists/{{archiveListId}}

### Restore the list. 204.
PUT {{prodigy_board_API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/lists/{{archiveListId}}/archived
X-User-Id: {{actorId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "value": false
}

### Search cards in the list. Card A is back and card B is still archived, so the restore brought back exactly what was hidden.
GET {{prodigy_board_API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/cards?listId={{archiveListId}}

### Archive the board. 204.
PUT {{prodigy_board_API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/boards/{{archiveBoardId}}/archived
X-User-Id: {{actorId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "value": true
}

### Search lists on the archived board. Nothing comes back under the default.
GET {{prodigy_board_API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/lists?boardId={{archiveBoardId}}

### Search cards in the list. Nothing comes back, because the board above the list is archived.
GET {{prodigy_board_API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/cards?listId={{archiveListId}}

### Search boards in the workspace. The archived board is gone and the spare board stays.
GET {{prodigy_board_API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/boards?workspaceId={{archiveWorkspaceId}}

### Search the board archive view. The archived board comes back.
GET {{prodigy_board_API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/boards?workspaceId={{archiveWorkspaceId}}&archived=only

### Read the archived board by id. 200.
GET {{prodigy_board_API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/boards/{{archiveBoardId}}

### Read the archived board's labels. The label still shows, because label search ignores archive.
GET {{prodigy_board_API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/labels?boardId={{archiveBoardId}}

### Delete card A, which isn't archived. 409 notArchived with a null field.
DELETE {{prodigy_board_API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/cards/{{archiveCardA}}
X-User-Id: {{actorId}}

### Delete the list, which isn't archived. 409 notArchived, even though the board above it is.
DELETE {{prodigy_board_API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/lists/{{archiveListId}}
